{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral: Steam Edition is a sandbox about exploration and freedom. Its central mechanic is astral projection: leaving your body to explore the world from a new perspective and interact with what\u2019s around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes three ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> \u2013 Open-world freeplay with money and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Build</strong> \u2013 Unlimited items and full creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> \u2013 Focused on vehicles, with cars spawning at the Boot and Rusty Nail shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles can be bought with in-game currency or spawned freely in Free Build. Shops exist as part of the pause menu, with more systems to come in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps are currently available: Islands, Crazy Road, and Flatland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a single developer named Daniel, with the help of tools like Universal Vehicle Controller by Perfect Games. Astral will keep expanding as I continue to learn and improve. Your support means a lot.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910490?t=1758074241","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910490?t=1758074241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910490/d5e2950ee4dc68d62b188d104a83e406c22a1028/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758074241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910490/d5e2950ee4dc68d62b188d104a83e406c22a1028/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758074241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes the use of firearms and stylized violence. The visuals are low-poly and not graphic, but players should be aware that guns and shooting mechanics are part of the gameplay. The game does not depict sexual content, sexual assault, self-harm, or extreme gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral: Steam Edition is a sandbox about exploration and freedom. Its central mechanic is astral projection: leaving your body to explore the world from a new perspective and interact with what\u2019s around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes three ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox</strong> \u2013 Open-world freeplay with money and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Build</strong> \u2013 Unlimited items and full creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive</strong> \u2013 Focused on vehicles, with cars spawning at the Boot and Rusty Nail shop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles can be bought with in-game currency or spawned freely in Free Build. Shops exist as part of the pause menu, with more systems to come in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three maps are currently available: Islands, Crazy Road, and Flatland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a single developer named Daniel, with the help of tools like Universal Vehicle Controller by Perfect Games. Astral will keep expanding as I continue to learn and improve. Your support means a lot.</p>","developers":["Astral Studios LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910490/4b671580bd6044750ba8dcca4b